## BUILDING AND DEPLOYING A PERSONAL API
---

## PROJECT OVERVIEW
In the previous proect (server deployment), we provisioned a linux server and configured nginx. Now, we will write a small API and deploy it. what this project aim to achieve include:

1. Build the API Write an API with the following three endpoints:
GET / : returns the following JSON response exactly:
{ "message": "API is running" } GET /health : returns the following JSON response exactly:
{ "message": "healthy" } GET /me : returns the following JSON response exactly:
{ "name": "Your Full Name", "email": "you@example.com", "github": "https://github.com/yourusername" } All three endpoints must return Content-Type: application/json, an HTTP status code of 200, and respond within 500ms.
